; A price that states its number but not its currency takes its Currency
; group's, as beancount's replace_currencies gives it before
; interpolation, so missing units are then interpolated at that price.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock

2020-02-01 * "Units from a number-only price"
  Assets:Cash   100 USD
  Assets:Stock  HOOL @ 5

2020-02-02 * "Units written"
  Assets:Cash   -10 USD
  Assets:Stock  2 HOOL @ 5

2020-02-03 balance Assets:Stock  -18 HOOL
